      <Parameter>
         <Name>Focus Scan Filtergram Images</Name>
         <ParameterKey>HDU:0</ParameterKey>
         <Description>Two-dimensional Level 0 SOT-FG focus-scan filtergram images stored in the FITS Primary HDU. Observations are made with the BFI or NFI at focus settings recorded by the FITS FOCUS keyword. The observing passband is indicated by the FITS WAVE keyword; the inspected samples include G-band images and NFI images labeled NFI no move. The images are not a continuous wavelength scan.</Description>
